Running cluster safety job only on one node of the cluster is enough for database inconsistency prevention and [split brain|https://confluence.atlassian.com/confkb/recovering-from-a-data-center-cluster-split-brain-656408710.html] detection. Running only on one node also frees up resources and prevents race conditions.

