This is the code I use for a Calendars Page.

h3. The purpose of this calendar is for your territory activities, events and travels.
{calendar:id=fbef4d52-241d-409a-93c7-032f16cb7e17|defaultView=list}
{calendar:id=fbef4d52-241d-409a-93c7-032f16cb7e17|defaultView=month}

I have to do two calls to the same calendar because I want to see the list and the month option.  It would be nice if the list / month was a toggle option - but that is not my issue for this improvment.

The issue is when the list is above the month view, there is a whole heap of white / dead space between the two.  This needs to be fixed otherwise, you could miss the calendar view.  I currently put list after the month view, but really, you want the list view first.

