description:
{panel:bgColor=#e7f4fa}
  *NOTE:* This suggestion is for *JIRA Server*. Using *JIRA Cloud*? [See the corresponding suggestion|http://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-39090].
  {panel}

Please update the [JIRA Supported Platforms|https://confluence.atlassian.com/display/JIRA/Supported+Platforms] page to recommend that database configuration should be set to UTF-8, and that more specific information about the collation of the database is detailed on the individual database configuration page themselves. 

Following that please review the individual database configuration pages and ensure they explicitly state what the "supported" collation is.

For example the [Oracle config page|https://confluence.atlassian.com/display/JIRA/Connecting+JIRA+to+Oracle] states the following:

{quote}
The recommended encoding is AL32UTF8 (the Oracle equivalent of Unicode UTF-8).
{quote}

This should be changed to the following:
{quote}
The *supported* encoding is AL32UTF8 (the Oracle equivalent of Unicode UTF-8).
{quote}

