the documentation for [Connecting JIRA to MySQL|https://confluence.atlassian.com/display/JIRA/Connecting+JIRA+to+MySQL] should mention some(all) of the my.cnf modifications mentioned in Confluence's [Database Setup For MySQL|https://confluence.atlassian.com/display/DOC/Database+Setup+For+MySQL].

