  {panel}

As per the description below from https://confluence.atlassian.com/display/JIRA/Running+JIRA+as+a+Service:
bq. Also, the JIRA logs are properly managed by the Windows service (found in logs\stdout*.log in your JIRA Home Directory, and rotated daily).

By default, {{logs\stdout*.log}} should be stored in JIRA Installation Directory instead of JIRA Home Directory. Please revise the message due to the document could make users confuse.

