  {panel}

Users using the inbuilt hsql database, sometimes lose admin access to their instance and look for a way to reset their admin password from the backend. Sometimes users in such a situation come across our [Retrieving the JIRA Administrator|https://confluence.atlassian.com/display/JIRA/Retrieving+the+JIRA+Administrator] documentation and it's not apparent to them that they would be able to run similar SQL queries against the inbuilt HSQL database.

Apparently, we could improve the documentation on [Retrieving the JIRA Administrator|https://confluence.atlassian.com/display/JIRA/Retrieving+the+JIRA+Administrator], to include a reference to [how to run sql queries against HSQL database|Running SQL commands in a HSQL database].

