It would be great if we can specify [in our documentation|https://confluence.atlassian.com/display/JIRA/Managing+Shared+Filters] the permission needed to edit a Filter Share.

By look at [this invalid bug|https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRA-31431], seems that you need to be part of the "JIRA Use" permission as well from the Global Permissions, usually associated to the jira-users group which is not intuitive. If I am administrator I should be able to do any administrative task in JIRA, including edit a filter created by me.

